WEBVTT

00:07.270 --> 00:09.360
<b>So I have a favor to ask.</b>

00:09.650 --> 00:12.650
<b>I'd like you to restore
this shredded up paper.</b>

00:12.650 --> 00:13.740
<b>What?</b>

00:13.740 --> 00:16.700
<b>I accidentally put something
really important through a shredder,</b>

00:16.700 --> 00:18.990
<b>so you know, if you could just
use that one spell.</b>

00:20.240 --> 00:22.500
<b>I know it's going to cost me something.</b>

00:22.830 --> 00:25.670
<b>So here!
This is my most favorite dress.</b>

00:26.710 --> 00:28.750
<b>For Witch Recovery to work,</b>

00:28.750 --> 00:32.050
<b>we need all the pieces to be by itself,
and somewhat all there.</b>

00:32.050 --> 00:32.880
<b>What?</b>

00:32.880 --> 00:35.550
<b>Since there's lots of other shredded
pieces of paper mixed in,</b>

00:35.550 --> 00:37.850
<b>I might need a hundred of those dresses.</b>

00:37.850 --> 00:39.050
<b>Oh, no.</b>

00:39.350 --> 00:40.600
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:40.600 --> 00:46.100
<b>No, I feel bad for having you guys
come over in the morning on a weekend.</b>

00:46.100 --> 00:48.020
<b>So, what was it?</b>

00:48.020 --> 00:51.280
<b>Why did you put such an important
document through the shredder?</b>

00:52.740 --> 00:55.320
<b>It was a letter addressed to me.</b>

00:55.820 --> 00:59.450
<b>It's from my mom
who died last year from an illness.</b>

01:00.910 --> 01:02.580
<b>The one who put it through the shredder...</b>

01:03.410 --> 01:04.580
<b>was my dad.</b>

02:37.550 --> 02:42.550
<b>DEAR KARA</b>

02:42.220 --> 02:43.550
<b>Dad?</b>

02:43.970 --> 02:45.260
<b>What are you reading?</b>

02:45.260 --> 02:48.020
<b>MISS KARA MINAMI</b>

02:46.100 --> 02:48.020
<b>Wait, that's Mom's writing.</b>

02:48.310 --> 02:52.440
<b>Did Mom write me a letter
when she was still alive?</b>

02:52.520 --> 02:53.480
<b>No, this is...</b>

02:53.480 --> 02:55.520
<b>Why are you opening and reading it?</b>

02:55.520 --> 02:56.440
<b>Let me see it!</b>

02:56.440 --> 02:57.650
<b>No, you can't!</b>

02:57.650 --> 02:59.740
<b>Why not? Come on!</b>

03:04.330 --> 03:07.080
<b>I'm sorry. Really.</b>

03:09.710 --> 03:11.120
<b>How could you?</b>

03:12.880 --> 03:16.050
<b>And I haven't spoken to him since.</b>

03:16.340 --> 03:20.420
<b>So there's something written in there
that he doesn't want you to know.</b>

03:21.010 --> 03:24.550
<b>But that's pretty horrible of him
to just shred it to pieces.</b>

03:26.180 --> 03:28.390
<b>All right, I got it, Kara.</b>

03:28.390 --> 03:32.060
<b>We'll restore the letter with magic
and find out what was written on there.</b>

03:32.310 --> 03:35.560
<b>But you said in this state... Huh?</b>

03:36.110 --> 03:37.730
<b>What're you doing, Nico?</b>

03:38.150 --> 03:39.900
<b>I'm separating the pieces of the letter.</b>

03:39.900 --> 03:40.950
<b>Are you serious?</b>

03:41.200 --> 03:44.700
<b>You can barely see it, but
this stationary has a green tint to it.</b>

03:45.030 --> 03:47.950
<b>And if you look closely, it's enough
to separate them from other pieces.</b>

03:48.240 --> 03:48.950
<b>I'll help.</b>

03:48.950 --> 03:50.200
<b>Whoa, that's totally fine.</b>

03:50.200 --> 03:52.370
<b>You don't have to do such a tedious task.</b>

03:52.370 --> 03:53.750
<b>Kara, you probably don't know,</b>

03:54.040 --> 03:57.630
<b>but when I was in fourth grade, I built
the Osaka Castle with just toothpicks.</b>

03:57.630 --> 04:00.340
<b>You're right, I totally didn't know
the depth of your determination.</b>

04:00.880 --> 04:03.840
<b>You always take care of us, Kara.</b>

04:04.090 --> 04:07.300
<b>I felt so happy
when you came to me for help.</b>

04:07.470 --> 04:11.100
<b>So not only through magic, but I want
to help you in as many ways as I can.</b>

04:11.640 --> 04:13.890
<b>I think I'll feel much happier that way, too.</b>

04:14.440 --> 04:15.560
<b>Nico.</b>

04:17.860 --> 04:20.150
<b>Squeeze!</b>

04:18.650 --> 04:20.150
<b>HUG</b>

04:21.360 --> 04:23.950
<b>Doing this is kind of fun, huh?</b>

04:23.950 --> 04:26.700
<b>Yeah! You strangely get focused on it.</b>

04:26.700 --> 04:28.490
<b>Just keep working, okay?</b>

04:28.830 --> 04:30.740
<b>I wonder if we'll finish by night.</b>

04:31.750 --> 04:36.460
<b>The truth is, I think I already know
what's written in that letter.</b>

04:36.460 --> 04:37.130
<b>What?</b>

04:37.500 --> 04:40.800
<b>My parents keep it a secret from me,
but I already know.</b>

04:41.760 --> 04:44.680
<b>That my dad isn't my real dad.</b>

04:45.970 --> 04:49.260
<b>When I was in seventh grade,
I went to go visit some relatives.</b>

04:49.350 --> 04:51.640
<b><i>Kara was a child from a previous marriage.</i></b>

04:51.720 --> 04:56.150
<b><i>I heard it was troublesome because
she wouldn't get along with her dad.</i></b>

04:56.690 --> 05:01.650
<b>Yeah, I was surprised, but I assumed
they were thinking about my happiness.</b>

05:01.820 --> 05:03.400
<b>So I pretended that I didn't know.</b>

05:03.860 --> 05:06.910
<b>It doesn't matter
if we're related by blood or not.</b>

05:07.360 --> 05:11.040
<b>Because the one who raised me was Dad.</b>

05:11.990 --> 05:15.160
<b>But I think it might matter to him.</b>

05:15.160 --> 05:15.920
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:16.170 --> 05:21.920
<b>But I've already accepted it,
and I think of Dad as my real dad.</b>

05:22.510 --> 05:24.800
<b>I'll always think of him that way.</b>

05:26.220 --> 05:28.300
<b>We did it!</b>

05:28.680 --> 05:31.760
<b>I feel like I can pick out
small gold nuggets at this point.</b>

05:31.760 --> 05:33.640
<b>I can't believe we did it.</b>

05:33.640 --> 05:34.680
<b>Um...</b>

05:35.020 --> 05:37.690
<b>Seriously, thank you for doing this for me.</b>

05:39.190 --> 05:41.360
<b>Okay, let's cast that spell.</b>

05:42.780 --> 05:44.360
<b>Witch Recovery!</b>

05:48.110 --> 05:50.120
<b>- It's restored!
- You did it.</b>

05:51.910 --> 05:54.620
<b>Mom's letter...</b>

05:55.200 --> 05:57.080
<b>So what did she write?</b>

05:57.080 --> 05:58.120
<b>Let's see...</b>

05:58.580 --> 06:00.880
<b>Dear Kara, I'm sorry.</b>

06:01.170 --> 06:05.880
<b><i>Regarding the illness, I believe it might
be fate so I've already accepted it.</i></b>

06:06.170 --> 06:09.640
<b><i>I will most likely
depart from this world soon.</i></b>

06:09.890 --> 06:14.060
<b>I didn't want anything
to change between us,</b>

06:14.060 --> 06:17.560
<b>so I'll write in this letter
what I've been wanting to tell you.</b>

06:18.100 --> 06:19.650
<b>Kara.</b>

06:19.900 --> 06:22.150
<b><i>You were a child
from your father's previous marriage.</i></b>

06:22.270 --> 06:25.030
<b>Wait, from Dad's?</b>

06:25.690 --> 06:26.650
<b>What?</b>

06:27.110 --> 06:29.200
<b><i>The mother who gave birth to you</i></b>

06:29.200 --> 06:32.910
<b><i>had disappeared before
she and your father could get married.</i></b>

06:33.370 --> 06:39.290
<b><i>So as a single parent, your father raised you
by himself, and met me afterwards.</i></b>

06:39.870 --> 06:43.090
<b>No way! So Dad is my real dad and...</b>

06:43.090 --> 06:45.250
<b>The one you weren't related to was...</b>

06:45.250 --> 06:47.130
<b>...your mother.</b>

06:47.300 --> 06:48.170
<b>Kara!</b>

06:49.130 --> 06:50.090
<b>Dad.</b>

06:50.090 --> 06:51.800
<b>That letter, how...</b>

06:52.180 --> 06:54.050
<b>We restored it.</b>

06:54.970 --> 06:59.440
<b>You were against the idea, so the mother
wanted to tell Kara through a letter.</b>

06:59.940 --> 07:05.940
<b>The mother must've felt guilty for lying
because she was the one not related by blood.</b>

07:06.820 --> 07:08.690
<b>It's Kara's letter.</b>

07:09.110 --> 07:11.490
<b>You can't push your feelings
into the situation.</b>

07:13.200 --> 07:16.120
<b>After Miyuki passed away, that letter
was delivered through the mail.</b>

07:16.120 --> 07:18.910
<b>I saw it first, and had a feeling, so I hid it.</b>

07:19.830 --> 07:22.880
<b>She already passed, and if Kara found out
that she wasn't her real mother,</b>

07:22.880 --> 07:26.420
<b>I got scared that there wouldn't be
a mother-daughter relationship anymore.</b>

07:27.250 --> 07:29.130
<b>The two were really alike.</b>

07:29.510 --> 07:33.550
<b>It's worse because Kara felt proud
that she looked like her mother.</b>

07:33.550 --> 07:34.550
<b>Dummy!</b>

07:34.850 --> 07:39.270
<b>It doesn't matter who I'm related to
by blood. I'm not going to change!</b>

07:39.980 --> 07:41.390
<b>That's right.</b>

07:41.810 --> 07:44.940
<b>That's the kind of person you are.
I was wrong.</b>

07:44.940 --> 07:47.440
<b>Will you forgive me, Kara?</b>

07:47.650 --> 07:49.690
<b>I'm sorry, Miyuki.</b>

07:49.820 --> 07:51.150
<b>Dad!</b>

07:51.780 --> 07:56.330
<b>Kara, there's more things
written on this letter.</b>

07:57.280 --> 07:59.910
<b>Please forgive our selfishness.</b>

08:00.330 --> 08:04.670
<b><i>I thought it would be best to keep it
a secret while you were still young.</i></b>

08:05.210 --> 08:07.090
<b><i>But you're an adult now, aren't you?</i></b>

08:08.000 --> 08:13.510
<b><i>This is a little earlier than planned,
but I wanted to tell you this myself.</i></b>

08:14.130 --> 08:17.680
<b><i>I remember the day
when I met you for the first time.</i></b>

08:17.680 --> 08:19.810
<b><i>You had just turned three,</i></b>

08:19.810 --> 08:23.310
<b><i>and you were being a bit difficult and weren't
getting along with your father.</i></b>

08:23.310 --> 08:24.100
<b><i>However...</i></b>

08:24.690 --> 08:27.400
<b>Hea, have this wady bug.</b>

08:28.610 --> 08:29.980
<b><i>I was so happy.</i></b>

08:30.860 --> 08:33.530
<b><i>I thought, "Oh wow, this girl
is going to become my daughter."</i></b>

08:35.570 --> 08:38.120
<b>And from that day on,</b>

08:38.490 --> 08:41.290
<b><i>spending time as a family
was like being in a dream.</i></b>

08:41.290 --> 08:43.120
<b><i>I'm so glad that I met your father.</i></b>

08:44.000 --> 08:47.670
<b><i>I'm so glad that you became my daughter.</i></b>

08:49.130 --> 08:50.300
<b><i>Thank you.</i></b>

08:57.390 --> 09:00.220
<b><i>I wanted to watch over you
as you grew up,</i></b>

09:00.220 --> 09:01.890
<b><i>but it looks like you'll be okay.</i></b>

09:02.350 --> 09:04.890
<b><i>Because you're strong, just like me.</i></b>

09:05.560 --> 09:11.900
<b><i>I'll be watching over you from Heaven.
With love, to my beloved daughter.</i></b>

09:23.160 --> 09:25.660
<b>Doesn't that cloud look like a fish?</b>

09:27.500 --> 09:28.670
<b>Hey, Nico.</b>

09:28.880 --> 09:31.170
<b>If I talk, I'll cry.</b>

09:36.010 --> 09:37.800
<b>The color of my magic stone...</b>

09:38.180 --> 09:40.680
<b>That's the one that turns more white</b>

09:40.680 --> 09:43.600
<b>as you grow as a witch
by helping people with your magic.</b>

09:43.600 --> 09:44.680
<b>Moi.</b>

09:45.480 --> 09:47.850
<b>I've been thinking about something.</b>

09:49.810 --> 09:50.560
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:54.440 --> 09:55.490
<b>Okay.</b>

09:55.490 --> 09:57.700
<b>If my magic could be useful to someone,</b>

09:57.700 --> 10:00.530
<b>I think there are lots more people
in trouble who I can help.</b>

10:00.530 --> 10:01.910
<b>It'll be good training, too.</b>

10:01.910 --> 10:03.870
<b>And the poster came out great, too.</b>

10:01.910 --> 10:06.290
<b>WITCH'S CONSULTATION
IS SOMETHING BOTHERING YOU?
LET ME HELP YOU RESOLVE IT!
ASK FOR NICO WAKATSUKI, CLASS 1-3</b>

10:03.870 --> 10:05.450
<b>I'm the one who drew it, though.</b>

10:08.870 --> 10:13.380
<b>NEW FRIEND</b>

10:10.880 --> 10:15.670
<b>Nico! There's someone in our class
who needs your help.</b>

10:18.180 --> 10:21.930
<b>My name is Jun Horai.
It's nice to meet you.</b>

10:22.140 --> 10:23.850
<b>The character design...</b>

10:24.060 --> 10:25.310
<b>It's nice to meet you.</b>

10:25.680 --> 10:27.310
<b>How are you today?</b>

10:28.520 --> 10:30.560
<b>Well, we're good.</b>

10:30.810 --> 10:33.570
<b>I am very glad to meet you.</b>

10:33.900 --> 10:36.650
<b>Hey Jun, did you grow up overseas?</b>

10:36.650 --> 10:39.070
<b>I'm from Saitama Prefecture.</b>

10:39.740 --> 10:42.410
<b>I listen to music every day.</b>

10:42.660 --> 10:44.950
<b>Instead of coffee, I like tea.</b>

10:45.290 --> 10:48.960
<b>I'm on the tennis team.
I have fun every day.</b>

10:48.960 --> 10:51.290
<b>He talks like the New Horizons textbook!</b>

10:51.580 --> 10:56.800
<b>Um, excuse my rudeness, but the way you talk
sounds like the English from New Horizons.</b>

10:56.800 --> 10:59.800
<b>Yes, there is a reason for that.</b>

11:00.550 --> 11:03.970
<b>My father is an English teacher.
He teaches at a middle school.</b>

11:04.100 --> 11:07.680
<b>I have many English textbooks
inside my house.</b>

11:08.180 --> 11:11.600
<b>I read those books a lot
when I was a child.</b>

11:12.230 --> 11:13.610
<b>I became like this.</b>

11:13.610 --> 11:14.940
<b>No, you shouldn't!</b>

11:15.150 --> 11:18.940
<b>Well, anyway, so you wanted to talk
to Nico about the way you speak...</b>

11:18.940 --> 11:22.160
<b>- I am having trouble with love.
- And not with the way you speak?</b>

11:22.160 --> 11:24.990
<b>Yes, I do have trouble with the way I speak.</b>

11:24.990 --> 11:26.120
<b>So you do, huh?</b>

11:26.120 --> 11:28.660
<b>But your trouble with love
is more important, right?</b>

11:28.660 --> 11:31.290
<b>Oh gosh, so you have
a crush on someone?</b>

11:31.420 --> 11:32.080
<b>Yes.</b>

11:32.080 --> 11:34.130
<b>Then go tell her how you feel right now.</b>

11:34.590 --> 11:35.710
<b><i>Lesson One.</i></b>

11:35.710 --> 11:40.050
<b><i>Jun fell in love with a girl who he sees
every day going to and from school.</i></b>

11:40.170 --> 11:42.050
<b>Just ask her out on a date.</b>

11:42.050 --> 11:44.350
<b>I'm too shy to approach her.</b>

11:44.350 --> 11:47.140
<b>So you want a reason
to talk to her, huh?</b>

11:47.140 --> 11:50.060
<b>I found a pen. I think she dropped it.</b>

11:50.060 --> 11:53.730
<b>There's your reason!
You should approach her with that.</b>

11:54.270 --> 11:55.730
<b>This is that pen.</b>

11:55.730 --> 11:58.400
<b>We're in the first semester
of seventh grade English.</b>

11:58.400 --> 11:59.690
<b>I'm there with you.</b>

11:59.690 --> 12:01.490
<b>You guys aren't continuing
the conversation.</b>

12:01.490 --> 12:03.950
<b>Nico, can you search with your magic?</b>

12:03.950 --> 12:05.700
<b>I cannot do that.</b>

12:05.700 --> 12:06.910
<b>Don't get sucked in!</b>

12:07.030 --> 12:10.290
<b>Her school is next to this park.</b>

12:10.500 --> 12:14.290
<b>Looks like everyone goes through this park
because it's a shortcut to the station.</b>

12:14.540 --> 12:17.500
<b>This makes things easy.
All you have to do is go talk to her.</b>

12:17.500 --> 12:19.670
<b>Yes. I think so, too.</b>

12:19.670 --> 12:21.920
<b>Have you been thinking
about what to talk about?</b>

12:22.760 --> 12:26.010
<b>I-I have two tickets to the movies.</b>

12:26.010 --> 12:28.310
<b>Oh, so you're going to ask her out on a date.</b>

12:28.640 --> 12:29.770
<b>That's pretty assertive.</b>

12:29.770 --> 12:32.180
<b>Are you gonna be okay
with the way you talk?</b>

12:32.390 --> 12:34.400
<b>Will they be able to hold a conversation?</b>

12:34.810 --> 12:37.770
<b>Nico, I have a favor to ask.</b>

12:38.440 --> 12:41.190
<b>Can you please cast a spell on me
that will make me better at conversations?</b>

12:42.780 --> 12:45.660
<b>I can, but I would like to refuse.</b>

12:45.660 --> 12:46.450
<b>What?</b>

12:46.780 --> 12:48.700
<b>There's nothing to be embarrassed about.</b>

12:48.700 --> 12:51.200
<b>You should talk how you normally do
with your crush.</b>

12:51.200 --> 12:54.250
<b>You should go talk to her as you are.</b>

12:57.630 --> 12:58.960
<b>I understand.</b>

13:01.670 --> 13:04.430
<b>Sorry. You can do it, Jun.</b>

13:04.430 --> 13:06.220
<b>Yes, of course. Oh!</b>

13:06.590 --> 13:07.970
<b>Here she comes!</b>

13:08.180 --> 13:09.970
<b>Okay, let's leave these two alone.</b>

13:09.970 --> 13:10.720
<b>Okay!</b>

13:10.970 --> 13:12.100
<b>We want the best for him,</b>

13:12.100 --> 13:14.940
<b>but I think the way he talks
might be rough for girls nowadays.</b>

13:14.940 --> 13:16.980
<b>Probably, but it'll be fine.</b>

13:17.400 --> 13:21.110
<b>It's just as Nico says. It's important
for them to get to know you.</b>

13:21.440 --> 13:23.940
<b>Sometimes it's better
for magic to take a backseat.</b>

13:24.110 --> 13:25.200
<b>U-Um...</b>

13:25.200 --> 13:28.240
<b>Hello, my name is Jun Horai.
It's nice to meet you.</b>

13:28.740 --> 13:30.660
<b>Is this your pen?</b>

13:30.660 --> 13:33.500
<b>It's my first time seeing
this phrase being used in daily life.</b>

13:33.700 --> 13:36.040
<b>Yes, that is my pen.</b>

13:36.620 --> 13:37.500
<b>Huh?</b>

13:37.500 --> 13:39.340
<b>My name is Ann Nikura.</b>

13:39.340 --> 13:41.500
<b>And this one's a New Crown!</b>

13:41.750 --> 13:44.300
<b>Where do you live?</b>

13:44.300 --> 13:49.010
<b>I live in Saino City.
What did you do yesterday?</b>

13:49.220 --> 13:52.470
<b>Yesterday, I played tennis in Saino City.</b>

13:52.470 --> 13:54.980
<b>I lost to a member named Kanta.</b>

13:54.980 --> 13:56.600
<b>That's my younger brother.</b>

13:56.600 --> 13:58.520
<b>They're somehow conversing?</b>

13:58.690 --> 14:00.520
<b>Maybe he can ask her out
on a date after all?</b>

14:00.520 --> 14:01.520
<b>Yay!</b>

14:01.860 --> 14:03.820
<b>Oh, looks like they're done talking.</b>

14:04.360 --> 14:05.530
<b>They're coming over here.</b>

14:06.150 --> 14:08.070
<b>This is my girlfriend.</b>

14:08.070 --> 14:09.530
<b>They're dating?</b>

14:09.740 --> 14:12.540
<b>I somehow feel a connection with him.</b>

14:12.540 --> 14:15.960
<b>So yeah, I thought I might have a shot,
and when I asked, I got an immediate "yes"!</b>

14:15.960 --> 14:18.420
<b>You're so excited that you're not talking
like a textbook anymore.</b>

14:18.750 --> 14:19.960
<b>But I'm proud of you!</b>

14:19.960 --> 14:21.130
<b>Congratulations!</b>

14:21.130 --> 14:22.250
<b>I wish you both the best!</b>

14:22.250 --> 14:24.170
<b>You'll have to tell your pen pal in Canada.</b>

14:24.170 --> 14:25.420
<b>I do not have one.</b>

14:27.720 --> 14:29.680
<b>Thank you so much.</b>

14:29.930 --> 14:32.680
<b>You are all my new friends.</b>

14:32.930 --> 14:34.350
<b>Please accept this gift.</b>

14:34.970 --> 14:38.440
<b>Instead of a movie, we will play tennis
this weekend.</b>

14:38.730 --> 14:40.230
<b>That's a movie I wanted to see.</b>

14:41.150 --> 14:42.570
<b>I'm not interested.</b>

14:42.570 --> 14:43.940
<b>I already watched it.</b>

14:46.030 --> 14:48.240
<b>Nico, wanna watch it with me?</b>

14:48.900 --> 14:50.990
<b>D-Does that mean...</b>

14:51.490 --> 14:53.490
<b>A-A date?</b>

14:54.490 --> 14:58.620
<b>Yes, I would like to go the movies
with you this weekend.</b>

15:01.460 --> 15:03.960
<b>KANTA NIKURA</b>

15:09.470 --> 15:14.930
<b>DATE WITH THE KNIGHT</b>

15:11.260 --> 15:15.810
<b>He just casually asked me out on a date,
so I don't understand what he's thinking.</b>

15:16.020 --> 15:19.560
<b>You can't really read his facial expressions
so it makes it even harder.</b>

15:19.560 --> 15:20.560
<b>That's the thing!</b>

15:20.810 --> 15:23.270
<b>He hasn't had any affectionate feelings
since the fourth grade,</b>

15:23.270 --> 15:25.440
<b>so how do you even handle that?</b>

15:25.440 --> 15:26.940
<b>She's a mess.</b>

15:27.190 --> 15:30.700
<b>Didn't Otogi say he liked comedy shows?</b>

15:31.030 --> 15:34.120
<b>Yes! When he's watching those,
he super laughs at them!</b>

15:34.120 --> 15:35.080
<b>That's right!</b>

15:35.280 --> 15:37.660
<b>So it's not like he doesn't have emotions.</b>

15:37.660 --> 15:40.210
<b>I think you should focus
on observation tomorrow.</b>

15:40.210 --> 15:42.330
<b>Yeah, instead of making yourself appealing,</b>

15:42.330 --> 15:45.420
<b>you should prioritize
getting to understand his emotions.</b>

15:45.590 --> 15:48.210
<b>Wow. Love is so difficult, isn't it?</b>

15:49.090 --> 15:51.010
<b>You just fell in love with a weird guy.</b>

15:53.430 --> 15:55.720
<b>Oh hey, you guys were all in Nico's room?</b>

15:56.010 --> 15:57.560
<b>- Oh, um...
- Well...</b>

15:57.560 --> 15:59.140
<b>Expressing expressions!</b>

15:59.140 --> 16:01.230
<b>Expressions... Poker face...</b>

16:01.480 --> 16:03.850
<b>We were playing poker!</b>

16:03.850 --> 16:05.020
<b>Playing poker?</b>

16:05.020 --> 16:07.400
<b>Y-Yeah, that's right. We were playing poker.</b>

16:07.400 --> 16:11.200
<b>Your facial expressions are hard to read,
so we thought you'd be too good at it.</b>

16:11.200 --> 16:14.740
<b>You didn't ask me because
my face is too hard to read.</b>

16:14.990 --> 16:16.990
<b>S-Sorry, man.</b>

16:16.990 --> 16:18.240
<b>It's fine.</b>

16:18.490 --> 16:21.410
<b>I don't really like
getting all rowdy like you guys do,</b>

16:21.410 --> 16:23.500
<b>so I probably would've declined
the offer.</b>

16:24.120 --> 16:27.550
<b>But I would've still liked to be invited.</b>

16:27.550 --> 16:30.710
<b>He's easy to understand
when he gets all pouty like this.</b>

16:33.760 --> 16:36.510
<b>Hard to understand
my facial expressions, huh?</b>

16:37.600 --> 16:40.270
<b>Okay. This is the spell.</b>

16:40.770 --> 16:43.270
<b>You want to cast a spell on me
that expresses my emotions more?</b>

16:43.520 --> 16:45.650
<b>There's a spell that can do that.</b>

16:45.650 --> 16:50.030
<b>But using spells like this without permission
is bad, so I wanted to ask you.</b>

16:50.820 --> 16:52.860
<b>That's probably a "no," right?</b>

16:54.910 --> 16:56.280
<b>- It's fine.
- What?</b>

16:56.410 --> 16:57.740
<b>I don't really understand,</b>

16:57.740 --> 17:01.040
<b>but if my expressions are hard to read,
then go ahead and make it easier to understand.</b>

17:01.330 --> 17:05.750
<b>If that'll allow my relationships to improve,
then you'd be doing me a favor.</b>

17:05.750 --> 17:09.170
<b>What? Are you upset?
Asking for a favor? I can't tell.</b>

17:09.920 --> 17:11.130
<b>Okay, here we go.</b>

17:11.130 --> 17:12.840
<b>Emotexpression!</b>

17:16.010 --> 17:17.180
<b>And it's done.</b>

17:20.010 --> 17:21.180
<b>A tiny Moi?</b>

17:21.390 --> 17:25.440
<b>Well? Am I easier to read?
How can you tell?</b>

17:25.690 --> 17:30.320
<b><i>Mini-Moi looks really confused,
and it's super easy to tell.</i></b>

17:30.520 --> 17:34.110
<b>Oh, um, let's see, I guess I can't tell yet.</b>

17:34.110 --> 17:36.570
<b><i>Who knew this spell
would come out like this?</i></b>

17:36.820 --> 17:39.580
<b>Huh. I guess it's your magic after all.</b>

17:40.080 --> 17:43.120
<b>We don't have much time,
so let's get ready and go.</b>

17:43.120 --> 17:46.290
<b>Yeah, it's a movie
you wanted to watch, right?</b>

17:46.290 --> 17:47.080
<b>Kind of, yeah.</b>

17:47.080 --> 17:48.960
<b><i>He looks super excited!</i></b>

17:52.880 --> 17:53.840
<b>Thanks for waiting.</b>

18:00.470 --> 18:02.060
<b>Why are you wearing a yukata?</b>

18:02.060 --> 18:05.100
<b>You said we'd go to the Summer Festival
in the evening, right?</b>

18:05.480 --> 18:06.730
<b>What do you think?</b>

18:06.980 --> 18:12.780
<b>Yeah. Yukatas were originally used as
bathrobes or pajamas, but in the present day,</b>

18:11.650 --> 18:14.070
<b><i>I don't want to hear
about its history.</i></b>

18:12.780 --> 18:14.780
<b>they've become proper clothes
to wear outside.</b>

18:14.070 --> 18:16.740
<b><i>But Mini-Moi loves it!</i></b>

18:16.950 --> 18:18.570
<b><i>He's so cute!</i></b>

18:18.700 --> 18:22.120
<b><i>But wait, why can't he just
honestly say that it looks nice?</i></b>

18:22.120 --> 18:23.240
<b>Come on, let's go.</b>

18:26.160 --> 18:27.460
<b>What kind of movie is it?</b>

18:27.460 --> 18:28.750
<b>You don't know anything about it?</b>

18:29.460 --> 18:31.960
<b>You'll laugh, you'll cry,
and you'll get surprised.</b>

18:31.960 --> 18:36.090
<b>It's an indoor-type Sci-Fi fantasy suspense
emotional rom-com action movie</b>

18:36.090 --> 18:39.760
<b>by Director Skalski, "Yali Tight Hold Die."</b>

18:39.760 --> 18:41.510
<b>It sounds pretty unhinged.</b>

18:41.510 --> 18:43.220
<b>NO RECORDING!</b>

18:42.350 --> 18:43.510
<b>It's starting.</b>

18:44.640 --> 18:48.140
<b><i>And we've got an action scene
going on. How's Moi doing?</i></b>

18:49.100 --> 18:51.020
<b><i>And how is Mini-Moi?</i></b>

18:51.360 --> 18:52.650
<b><i>He looks super nervous!</i></b>

18:54.820 --> 18:56.150
<b><i>He looks super scared!</i></b>

18:56.440 --> 18:58.650
<b>The moon is beautiful!</b>

18:59.110 --> 19:00.660
<b><i>He's crying so much.</i></b>

19:00.950 --> 19:03.490
<b>This thing is like a dinner party!</b>

19:04.910 --> 19:07.120
<b><i>For the funny scenes,
the real face is laughing, too.</i></b>

19:07.580 --> 19:10.790
<b><i>It's way more fun to watch Moi
instead of the movie.</i></b>

19:15.340 --> 19:16.880
<b>Did you enjoy the movie?</b>

19:17.170 --> 19:18.090
<b>Eh, yeah.</b>

19:18.260 --> 19:20.300
<b><i>Looks like he really enjoyed it.</i></b>

19:20.590 --> 19:23.050
<b>When the main character
jumped off the building,</b>

19:23.050 --> 19:25.510
<b>it seemed like it was CGIed,
but it actually wasn't.</b>

19:25.930 --> 19:28.430
<b>They wanted to make it look real,
and wanted the audience</b>

19:27.560 --> 19:29.640
<b><i>When he laughs and explains things,</i></b>

19:28.430 --> 19:32.520
<b>to experience a Sci-Fi world
that really isn't Sci-Fi.</b>

19:29.640 --> 19:32.520
<b><i>they both make the same face,
and it's kind of the best.</i></b>

19:32.940 --> 19:34.190
<b>What did you think, Nico?</b>

19:34.190 --> 19:37.900
<b>Y-Yeah, I thought it was fun how
the main character was very expressive.</b>

19:38.150 --> 19:40.610
<b><i>I'll just rewatch the movie
when it comes out on Prime.</i></b>

19:46.200 --> 19:49.080
<b>Wow! Thanks, Mister!</b>

19:49.080 --> 19:52.960
<b><i>That's right, Moi isn't simply expressionless.</i></b>

19:53.580 --> 19:56.170
<b><i>He's always doing things for other people.</i></b>

19:56.170 --> 19:59.720
<b><i>When he makes people happy,
it makes him happy in his heart, too.</i></b>

20:02.470 --> 20:04.350
<b><i>He just doesn't show it on his face.</i></b>

20:05.350 --> 20:10.230
<b><i>His heart is filled with so many emotions.</i></b>

20:14.020 --> 20:15.980
<b>Wow, it's so beautiful.</b>

20:15.980 --> 20:18.440
<b>It's been a while since I saw fireworks!</b>

20:22.320 --> 20:26.120
<b>Nico, based on your spell, what kind
of expression do I have right now?</b>

20:27.030 --> 20:28.990
<b>You have a big smile on your face.</b>

20:29.330 --> 20:30.120
<b>I see.</b>

20:33.210 --> 20:34.210
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

20:34.210 --> 20:35.000
<b>Huh?</b>

20:35.000 --> 20:37.380
<b>It's hard for me
to express my emotions.</b>

20:39.510 --> 20:44.390
<b>No, that's okay, I should be apologizing.
You must be upset.</b>

20:44.720 --> 20:46.890
<b>No, I'm not upset or anything.</b>

20:47.430 --> 20:49.390
<b>It's probably because of my training.</b>

20:50.100 --> 20:53.690
<b>It's a disadvantage in a fight
if your opponent can read you.</b>

20:53.890 --> 20:55.400
<b>Plus I have this personality to begin with,</b>

20:55.690 --> 20:58.650
<b>so I must've formed a habit
where I push down my emotions.</b>

20:59.190 --> 21:01.320
<b>I'm not constantly
in a bad mood or anything.</b>

21:01.740 --> 21:03.400
<b>Yeah, I know.</b>

21:03.610 --> 21:05.910
<b>Let me dispel the magic.</b>

21:10.040 --> 21:15.670
<b>We're around each other a lot, so I wanted
to know the things you were feeling.</b>

21:16.080 --> 21:19.420
<b>Everyone knows that you have a kind heart.</b>

21:19.920 --> 21:22.970
<b>And I want to become
someone like that, too.</b>

21:24.130 --> 21:25.630
<b>I had fun today.</b>

21:25.630 --> 21:26.590
<b>Really?</b>

21:27.140 --> 21:27.930
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:28.760 --> 21:32.310
<b>I've actually become more expressive
ever since you arrived at the house.</b>

21:32.930 --> 21:36.350
<b>Since I'm strong,
I tend to end up hurting people,</b>

21:36.350 --> 21:38.650
<b>so I never really
maintained any friendships.</b>

21:39.610 --> 21:42.110
<b>I like quietly spending time by myself.</b>

21:43.400 --> 21:44.110
<b>But...</b>

21:48.700 --> 21:51.120
<b>Lately, every day has become so rowdy.</b>

21:52.160 --> 21:54.710
<b>And that kind of daily life isn't bad either.</b>

21:57.120 --> 21:58.580
<b>Every day is fun.</b>

22:06.220 --> 22:08.930
<b>Oh! It looks like
Kan and Keigo are here, too.</b>

22:08.930 --> 22:11.510
<b>The fireworks are over,
so why don't we go meet with them?</b>

22:11.810 --> 22:14.270
<b>I mean it's fine, right?</b>

22:14.270 --> 22:16.230
<b>Meeting up with them
sounds kind of troublesome.</b>

22:19.400 --> 22:20.980
<b>Let's keep having fun.</b>

22:21.320 --> 22:23.860
<b>Which one do you wanna eat,
takoyaki or grilled imagawayaki?</b>

22:23.860 --> 22:24.990
<b>Grilled squid!</b>

23:57.870 --> 24:01.250
<b>What did you think
about this week's episode?</b>

24:01.250 --> 24:04.500
<b>I thought it was a very fun episode.</b>

24:04.500 --> 24:07.250
<b>So are you a Shonen Jump fan?</b>

24:06.670 --> 24:12.010
<b>NEXT EPISODE

TROPE-TACULAR STUDENT COUNCIL
A STRAY CAT'S BUBBLE OF BLISS</b>

24:07.250 --> 24:10.800
<b>No, I am not.
I am a fan of Shonen Magaz—</b>
